==English==

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|/flɛks/}}
* {{audio|en-us-flex.ogg|Audio (US)}}
* {{rhymes|ɛks}}
* {{homophones|lang=en|flecks}}

===Etymology===
{{etyl|la|en}} {{lena}} {{term|flexus|lang=la}}, past participle of {{term|flectere|lang=la||to bend}}.

===Noun===
{{en-noun|~|es}}

# {{context|uncountable|lang=en}} [[flexibility|Flexibility]], [[pliancy]].
# {{context|countable|lang=en}} The act of [[flexing]].
# {{context|uncountable|chiefly|British|lang=en}} Any flexible [[insulated]] [[electrical]] [[wiring]].
# {{context|countable|geometry|lang=en}} A [[point of inflection]].

